
  <sn><md>### Running `rclone config`

To start configuring Rclone remotes, run:

```bash
rclone config
```

You'll see a menu similar to:

```text
Current remotes:

Name                 Type
====                 ====
                       

e) Edit existing remote
n) New remote
d) Delete remote
r) Rename remote
c) Copy remote
s) Set configuration password
q) Quit config
```
</md></sn>
